<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 540 million.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 540 million.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction June 3 versus May 27</p>
<p>			THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   193/200		344/351</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.14/3.14	    3.33/3.33</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.14/3.14	    3.33/3.34</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.12/3.12	    3.32/3.33</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million   340/670		200/200</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    470/1,000	    330/620</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 45,704 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
